※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4004

※ An element of an array is written only through a name that says it may be,
※ as a field of a record is: an array not marked `mut` is read and not
※ written, whoever holds it -- a parameter included.

@[impure]
fn clear(a: u8⟦⟧):
    a⟦0⟧ ← 0u8

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    0u6
